Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:04.44,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Well, apparently I've discovered that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:07.52,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I can take these yawn-filled days
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.48,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And turn them into movies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:13.49,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I've found the secret and trick to it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.45,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Under this sky where we don't get along
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:19.54,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I closed my heart and locked it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:22.58,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That's how I've managed to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:24.58,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And the melodies now overlap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:31.34,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I wanted a sign, no matter how small
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:38.26,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That I could actually find \Nbetter than any streetlight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:45.14,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I put a ribbon on each of the \Nsights that my eyes pick out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:51.07,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And I collect them like souvenirs \Nas I continue down this path home
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.07,0:00:57.07,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,The seasons each say hello, \Nand I shed a few tears as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:01:03.33,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Where should I begin to talk about \Nthis way home that you've given me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:11.46,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I walk and walk and sometimes \Nrush on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:23.64,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I run and run, wait, no, I should \Nstill walk on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:36.74,sign_2226_17_CARRY_OUT_THE_GR,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(30,190)\fnTrebuchet MS\fsp2\fad(898,1)}CARRY OUT THE GRIFFIN PLAN
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:44.77,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Morning, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.74,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Morning, pwease, Becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:49.32,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Did you see yesterday's \Nepisode of {\i1}Berlint in Love{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:53.39,main,Becky,0,0,0,,The two characters finally reunited \Nafter overcoming so many obstacles!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.39,0:01:57.96,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, and my heart just wouldn't stop pounding \Nat the embrace scene with Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.59,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I like cartoons more than dramas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:04.26,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, you're still such a child, Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.26,0:02:07.43,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You're probably not interested \Nin romance at all, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:09.77,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I take back what I said about you being mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:12.51,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Are you talking about flirty stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:15.83,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I guess you're too young to understand yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:19.01,main,Becky,0,0,0,,If you have love, you can even fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:20.27,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:22.98,top,Becky,0,0,0,,You never know when it'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:25.28,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Hmph! Look at them getting all excited over \Nsomething so stupid first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:29.80,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Our midterms are coming up soon, too. \NI wonder if those two are even studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:31.65,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, Second Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.23,0:02:35.45,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Previously on {\i0}SPY x FAMILY{\i1}...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:38.10,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Second Son couldn't understand \Nhow awesome Bond is,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:40.68,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,meaning Anya had failed \Nthe Friendship Scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.38,0:02:44.77,flashbacktop,Anya Playing Damian,0,0,0,,If you can think up an \Nawesome name for your dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:47.89,sign_7726_70_He_was_worried__,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(165,280)\fscx80\fad(1025,1)}He never said this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.77,0:02:47.61,flashbacktop,Anya Playing Damian,0,0,0,,I'll let you come over to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:54.40,sign_4065_41_Second_Son_s_Hom,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs13\bord2\3c&H9EAFB5&\pos(165,20)\fad(191,1)}Second Son's House
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:52.12,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Will Anya be able to overcome \NSecond Son's bullying
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.12,0:02:54.39,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,and complete her mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.23,0:02:58.40,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's battle continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:00.48,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Fank you very much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:05.90,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,So for that reason, \NI brought a secret weapon today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.46,0:03:11.43,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I asked Papa yesterday to have another \Nfamily photo taken, this time with Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.43,0:03:12.99,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,If I show him this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.47,0:03:17.15,main,Anya Playing Damian,0,0,0,,Whoa! What the heck is this giant dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:19.63,main,Anya Playing Damian,0,0,0,,Let's battle to see whose dog is stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:21.93,main,Anya Playing Damian,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for ignoring you the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:24.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,His name is Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:33.15,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, noes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:38.66,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I have dropped the photo with \Nmy very cool dog in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:40.65,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya is so clumsy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.59,0:03:45.38,main,Damian,0,0,0,,The range of possible questions \Nfor the exam is so wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:47.65,main,Emile,0,0,0,,It really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:51.87,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:54.14,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, for crying out loud. Just leave them be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.14,0:03:58.15,main,Becky,0,0,0,,This is why a mature guy is so \Nmuch better than those children.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:01.83,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Anya. You dropped something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:09.11,main,Becky,0,0,0,,He's so amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:13.37,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Who in the world is this \Nunbelievably hot guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.37,0:04:15.64,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Are you telling me this is your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.64,0:04:17.85,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hello?! You never told me about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.85,0:04:19.49,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Introduce me to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.49,0:04:23.31,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Well? What's his name? Is he \Nseeing someone right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:26.98,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa is married to Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:30.11,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hey, I'll be keeping this picture, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.74,0:04:33.34,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:36.97,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Give that back! I need to show Second Son!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.97,0:04:38.59,top,Becky,0,0,0,,He's so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.97,0:04:39.14,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Ugh! They're so obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:46.90,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,We will now begin your \Narts and crafts class,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:49.51,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,but because Master Rodin is out sick today,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.51,0:04:52.50,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I will be acting as your \Nsubstitute instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:58.07,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Your assignment today will be making \Na 3D object out of these materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:05:00.17,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,The theme will be "animals."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:03.36,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,First, we will be randomly \Ndividing you into groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:07.02,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Each group will only be given \Na limited number of resources,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:10.10,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,so you will need to discuss their \Nuse with your groupmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:11.52,main,Kids,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:18.56,top,Henderson,0,0,0,,Group one: Herman Clark, \NEdward Perkshire, Paler Nomney...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:16.72,main,Emile,0,0,0,,This sounds like a fun class!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.72,0:05:17.90,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,What are you going to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:18.63,main,Emile,0,0,0,,I'm—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.63,0:05:20.94,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hmph. This is some dumb kid's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.94,0:05:22.35,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.35,0:05:24.55,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,A-Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:27.43,main,Student A,0,0,0,,I heard from someone in Class 2 that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:30.97,main,Student A,0,0,0,,important people from the school are \Ngoing to come look at our projects.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:34.55,main,Student B,0,0,0,,Wow... This might actually \Naffect our grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:38.05,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hmm... I guess I'll take \Nthis somewhat seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:42.11,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey, you two. Don't hold me back \Nif we end up in the same group.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:44.06,main,Emile and Ewen,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.06,0:05:49.44,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Next, group four: \NDamian Desmond, Anya Forger...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:51.90,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,This is my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:53.32,main,Damian,0,0,0,,God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:56.00,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I had a feeling this would happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:58.91,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You! Don't you dare think \Nof getting in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:04.24,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Aw, we ended up in different groups, Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.79,0:06:07.76,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Gimme back the picture. \NI need to show Second Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:09.09,main,Becky,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.09,0:06:11.74,main,Becky,0,0,0,,But you said I could have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:13.70,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I did not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:15.50,top,Becky,0,0,0,,Make sure you give me a different \Nphoto if you have one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:16.14,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I say, have a seat, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.10,0:06:19.70,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Now I'll just have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:21.35,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,use these materials...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:25.55,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,to create a cool-looking Bond \Nand show it off to Second Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.17,0:06:27.85,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,All right, begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.24,main,Girl student 1,0,0,0,,I'm going to make a bunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.65,main,Boy student 2,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:32.91,main,Boy student 3,0,0,0,,Do you have enough paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.41,0:06:36.64,main,Student A,0,0,0,,Let me see that pen next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:39.35,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Of course, their creativity\N and ability to share
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.35,0:06:44.28,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,limited materials within a group\N will affect their marks,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:47.33,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,but we must truly pay attention \Nto their restraint.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:52.26,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Cooperation, flexibility, enthusiasm, \Nand uniqueness are also...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:54.12,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:59.54,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Becky Blackbell, what is that you're making?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:03.51,main,Becky,0,0,0,,It's Anya's father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:06.56,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Loid Forger?! This is {\i0}too{\i0} unique!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.56,0:07:11.28,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Also, you can put on the combat suit \Nmy family's company is making...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:15.33,main,Becky,0,0,0,,As an optional item!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:17.98,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Er, I commend you for \Nyour elegant creativity,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:19.94,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,but I told you the theme was "animals."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:21.30,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Start over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.35,0:07:24.71,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Master Henderson...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:27.18,main,Becky,0,0,0,,In the end, humans are animals, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:30.26,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,'Tis true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.65,0:07:33.11,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll allow this, Blackbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.11,0:07:34.65,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,You win this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.65,0:07:38.10,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, but my sweet Loid must be \Na super-intellectual person,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:39.68,main,Becky,0,0,0,,so calling him an animal is rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.22,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I'll make something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.22,0:07:42.02,main,Girl student,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.99,0:07:46.31,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:09.22,main,Anya,0,0,0,,His name is Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:15.05,main,Damian,0,0,0,,So you're into naming garbage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:21.57,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Operation Dog has reached its end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.57,0:08:24.89,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,What operation? Also, that \Nwas supposed to be a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:27.85,main,Emile,0,0,0,,What are you making, Lord Damian?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.85,0:08:28.52,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.11,0:08:32.70,main,Damian,0,0,0,,A griffin, just like the one in my family crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:36.28,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Impressive as ever, Lord Damian! \NWhat an outstanding choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:39.52,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Griffin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:41.78,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Are they related to Mister Chimera?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:46.14,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm going to need a lot of paper,\Nso you guys better use it sparingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:46.95,main,Student C,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:48.28,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,But of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.11,0:08:52.83,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Since my family name is involved, \NI can't make anything bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:56.81,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,I know! If I can make this thing amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:08:59.63,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Father, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:02.55,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I created the heraldic beast \Nof the Desmond family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:05.73,main,Desmond,0,0,0,,Oho, quite impressive indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.73,0:09:09.82,main,Desmond,0,0,0,,You've accurately depicted our \Nfamily's dignity and elegance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:13.83,main,Desmond,0,0,0,,You are truly the pride of \Nthe Desmond family, Damian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:19.76,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,If only...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:25.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Second Son, Anya will help \Nyou make your griffin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.37,0:09:27.78,main,Anya Playing Damian,0,0,0,,Really? You're so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.78,0:09:29.09,main,Anya Playing Damian,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:32.13,main,Anya Playing Damian,0,0,0,,Look, Father! Isn't this griffin amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:35.25,main,Anya Playing Damian,0,0,0,,Miss Anya helped make half of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:39.09,main,Anya Playing Desmond,0,0,0,,You have excellent taste, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.42,0:09:43.44,main,Anya Playing Desmond,0,0,0,,I would love to see your \Nparents! Bring them here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:48.32,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Mission complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:54.30,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Operation Dog is now \NOperation Griffin. It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.30,0:09:54.98,main,Student C,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:59.55,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Will I have enough time and \Nmaterials to finish it, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:01.22,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,These wings are gonna be a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:02.23,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Second Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.83,0:10:03.36,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:07.58,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya will help you make that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.57,0:10:10.89,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You can use my paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.89,0:10:14.17,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?\N Make your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:15.75,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.75,0:10:18.92,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You're going to turn {\i1}that{\i0} in? Are you insane?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:22.16,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I want to help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:24.55,main,Damian,0,0,0,,F-F-F...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:25.95,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Fine! Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:31.11,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Ooh, what's this? Is that \Nwhat's going on, Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:34.32,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,I was wondering why she was \Nso obsessed with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:38.95,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Then you can make its hind legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:40.67,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.67,0:10:45.44,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Oh? So they're going to make \Na masterpiece together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:49.83,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Most intriguing, Forger and Desmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:53.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:55.88,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh? What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:57.48,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I told you to make legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:11:01.90,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I made it jet engines so it can go zoom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.13,0:11:06.82,main,Damian,0,0,0,,No one asked you to put weird stuff on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:10.70,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Never mind! Make the feathers instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:11.86,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:13.59,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.35,0:11:15.91,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Don't "ta-da" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:17.43,main,Damian,0,0,0,,They're all sloppy and uneven!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.43,0:11:19.69,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Do you really think it can fly \Nwith that many feathers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.69,0:11:22.42,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It has jet engines,\N so it can still fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.42,0:11:23.74,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm not using those!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:26.96,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Just butt out! How could you \Nwaste this much paper?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:28.23,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You're so useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:29.92,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:32.91,main,Student C,0,0,0,,Damian, I think that's a little harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.91,0:11:35.57,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Shut up! Hand over your paper, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.57,0:11:36.79,main,Student C,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.79,0:11:38.92,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,I cannot let this pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:41.06,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Not elegant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.13,0:11:46.92,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Would you call your actions \Ngentlemanly, Desmond?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:51.64,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,But... Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.64,0:11:55.94,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,It's no use. I won't be able to complete \Nit properly because of that shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.94,0:11:59.06,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,I really wanted to show this to Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:04.19,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,You do not need to rush, Desmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.19,0:12:08.66,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Just do everything you can \Nwithin your limits right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:12.02,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,But that's not enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.51,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Time is up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:22.47,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Make sure you line up your \Ncreations in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:24.03,main,Students,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:26.23,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Your giraffe's legs are so stubby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:29.98,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Well, look at that ridiculous \Nmane on your lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:32.84,main,Becky,0,0,0,,My creation is clearly the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:37.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Second Son... I'm sorry I was so useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:41.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You can have this instead of the feathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:42.73,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:45.98,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What is this? It's just the garbage you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.47,0:12:49.04,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I turned it into a girl griffin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:51.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Make it a pair with yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.32,0:12:54.82,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh? Why do I need to add that to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:57.34,main,Anya,0,0,0,,A...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:13:01.41,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Apparently, if you have love, you can fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:03.43,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:12.09,main,Official A,0,0,0,,Oho. Are these the sculptures \Nfrom our first graders?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.45,0:13:15.11,main,Official A,0,0,0,,They are all quite adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:21.82,main,Official A,0,0,0,,Th-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:25.61,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:37.62,main,Damian,0,0,0,,That sculpture... won the top prize?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:42.25,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,One of the officials from the board of \Neducation was quite impressed with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.54,0:13:46.05,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,"The fact that it still looked so regal \Ndespite having its wings torn apart
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:50.36,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,made me think that our country still had a \Nfuture and could recover from this war."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:53.23,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:55.35,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,That piece of garbage? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:57.13,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Impressive as ever, Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:13:58.76,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Good form!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.57,0:14:02.91,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Apparently, he couldn't hold back his tears
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:07.27,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,when he saw the corpse of the \Ninnocent baby griffin next to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.38,0:14:16.53,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Th-That's great. You can \Nshow it off to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:19.04,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,All according to plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.53,0:14:20.54,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:24.54,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Like I could ever show that \Npathetic thing to my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:27.25,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:32.84,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Operation Griffin... has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.23,0:14:42.55,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:44.77,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Yes, Jeeves, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:47.76,top,Student A,0,0,0,,That elephant was really weird, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:50.53,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm fine. Is Max well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.63,top,Student B,0,0,0,,It was so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.97,0:14:55.27,italics,Jeeves,0,0,0,,Yes. Will you be returning during break?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:15:01.79,main,Damian,0,0,0,,No... Father won't be home anyway, will he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:03.71,italics,Jeeves,0,0,0,,He... will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:07.29,italics,Jeeves,0,0,0,,But Master Demmy will be returning home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:13.51,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I have exams coming up, so I'll stay \Nhere to concentrate on my studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:15.82,italics,Jeeves,0,0,0,,Brilliant, Young Master Dammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.30,0:15:19.62,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Today, in arts and crafts class...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:26.39,italics,Jeeves,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.39,0:15:28.01,main,Damian,0,0,0,,No, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.55,0:15:35.95,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Jeeves... You told Father about \Nmy orientation, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.59,0:15:39.03,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Did he say anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:42.70,italics,Jeeves,0,0,0,,Why, yes, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:45.80,italics,Jeeves,0,0,0,,He was quite worried about your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.41,0:15:50.66,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,You liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.07,0:15:53.09,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I see. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.09,0:15:54.35,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm going to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.27,0:16:06.44,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Father has never worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:16.57,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, that was just a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:17.21,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Ewen, Emile...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:18.73,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Oh, Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:20.36,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Are you done with your phone call?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:24.57,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Yeah. Once we're done eating, let's study \Nfor our exams with some instructors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:26.32,main,Emile,0,0,0,,But of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.32,0:16:29.75,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Let's concentrate most on English, \Nsince it's your weakest subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.75,0:16:30.89,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:33.71,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.73,0:16:39.15,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,I really will have to become \Nan Imperial Scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.16,0:16:42.01,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,The top prize...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:46.23,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,The top prize?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:51.31,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sylvia Sherwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.31,0:16:55.64,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,A handler at WISE, the Westalis \NIntelligence Services Eastern-Focused division.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:58.44,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Age: ■■. Single.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:03.90,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Officially, she performs duties as an \Nattaché at Westalis's embassy in the East.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.90,0:17:07.18,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,And unofficially, she commands \Na number of intelligence agents
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:10.16,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,despite being under strict \Nsurveillance by the Secret Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.99,0:17:13.48,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Because of her constantly \Nflawless performance,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:17.31,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,her agents call her "Fullmetal Lady,"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.31,0:17:18.51,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and are in awe of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.51,0:17:22.47,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(455,295)\fscx70}FULLMETAL LADY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:38.75,main,Eastern Security Service Agent A,0,0,0,,We will now begin our operation to \Ntail Westalis's Secretary Sherwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.09,0:17:46.74,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I should praise them for \Ntheir persistence, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.76,0:17:51.92,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,The same clothes, the same shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:54.93,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,the same route...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:18:00.89,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Every Wednesday, I go to the public pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:12.42,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Having continuously been \Nshown Sylvia's routine,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:16.23,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,their slow little minds come to a halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:20.42,main,Eastern Security Service Agent B,0,0,0,,The same ol' pool...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:22.90,main,Eastern Security Service Agent A,0,0,0,,She's gonna be in there for at least an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.90,0:18:24.40,main,Eastern Security Service Agent A,0,0,0,,Guess we can get some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:27.68,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,As long as I can create some free time,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:29.46,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,being able to act freely
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.46,0:18:32.37,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,is not a difficult task, \Ndespite being in the enemy nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:39.39,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Now, then. I should head to \Nmy meeting spot with Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:42.02,main,Eastern Security Service Agent B,0,0,0,,And then the fool tripped and fell flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:44.14,main,Eastern Security Service Agent A,0,0,0,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:49.72,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,This coat I just bought isn't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:56.68,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Fools who let down their guard \Ncannot survive in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.27,0:19:02.58,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Good day, or perhaps good evening,\N Agent Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:08.91,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,That covers the details of the \NDesmond camp's financial reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:14.42,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,One of them is a paper company, \Nand though their public numbers are low...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:16.03,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I can't tell her...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:20.85,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,that her brand-new coat still has the tag on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:22.35,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:27.91,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,could never tell the Fullmetal \NLady, the Handler, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.69,0:19:38.31,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Loid Forger. Code name: Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.31,0:19:42.79,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,A WISE agent who always pulls off his \Nmissions and wants nothing but peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.64,0:19:47.10,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,An aloof spy who threw away any \Nchance at normal happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.93,0:19:51.79,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Every meeting with the Handler \Nputs our lives at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:56.13,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,If there is anyone tailing the Handler,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:00.37,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,we must naturally shake them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.67,0:20:08.48,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Two to the north, and one to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.15,0:20:10.69,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Shall we cancel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:13.93,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,No, we will meet at Point C.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.97,0:20:16.91,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Let's take care of this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.91,0:20:17.94,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.11,0:20:21.87,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This is how we exchange information
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:25.41,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,every day to preserve the peace \Nbetween the East and West.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:30.42,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Good day, or perhaps good evening,\N Agent Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.43,0:20:35.03,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Report your progress with Operation Strix.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:39.81,main,Loid,0,0,0,,My daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:43.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,can now clear two levels on the jump box.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:49.11,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She can also now jump \Nrope five times in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.99,0:20:53.97,italics,Sylvia,0,0,0,,What in the world is he on about?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.95,0:22:33.95,sign_32319_339_Omelet_Rice___,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,230)\shad1.5\fsp6}Omelet Rice{\c&H322BDC&}♥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.95,0:22:33.95,sign_32319_339_Omelet_Rice___,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,230)\bord4\shad0\fsp6}Omelet Rice♥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.07,0:22:33.95,main,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Yuri! I tried to cook something!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.18,0:22:35.86,main,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Here's some omelet rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.86,0:22:38.34,main,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.60,0:22:40.57,main,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,I have no idea what this \Nsubstance could be!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.57,0:22:42.56,main,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,Down the hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.09,0:22:46.59,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fnArial Black\pos(320,150)\fs40\fad(480,1)}Please wait a little while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:53.48,main,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.48,0:22:56.16,main,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,It's so good, Sis! Barf!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:57.85,main,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, that's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.50,0:23:01.35,main,Young Yor,0,0,0,,I'll try to make you home-cooked \Nmeals from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.35,0:23:03.63,main,Young Yor,0,0,0,,I tried making some cream-sauce pasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.63,0:23:06.89,main,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,Wow! Nothing here resembles pasta at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.89,0:23:07.86,main,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.88,0:23:12.90,main,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Ta-da! Here's some cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.90,0:23:17.37,main,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,Wow! I've never seen cake \Nso blue! That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.12,0:23:30.07,main,Young Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis, you're such an amazing cook, \NI bet you can get married in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.22,0:23:32.72,main,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.72,0:23:34.48,main,Young Yor,0,0,0,,Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.54,0:23:44.80,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,And so this man obtained an invincible body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.23,0:23:48.61,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,So you were dizzy because you'd \Nstayed up for four nights
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.61,0:23:50.85,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,and then got run over by a truck yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.85,0:23:51.91,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.54,0:23:54.14,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:09.91,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(420,235)\fscx57}UNCLE THE PRIVATE TUTOR\NDAYBREAK
